% https://dnd.wizards.com/resources/systems-reference-document redirects there).
% Checked 2026-09-27. Only line breaks were changed: the PDFs break
% "systems-reference-document" (French 5.1) and ".../4.0/legalcode" (5.2.1)
% across lines. URLs are wrapped in \url so they break and link.
%
% Wizards publishes translated statements with its translated SRDs (5.1 and
% 5.2.1; there are none for 5.2). The statement follows the document language
% when a translation exists, and falls back to English.
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

% #1 - SRD version, #2 - language, #3 - statement
\cs_new_protected:Npn \__dnd_srd_statement_new:nnn #1#2#3
  { \tl_const:cn { c__dnd_srd_ #1 _ #2 _tl } {#3} }

